flowchart LR
    A["Content chunk approved<br/>in SharePoint"] -->
    B["Power Automate sends<br/>publisher notification"]

    B --> C["Publisher opens repository<br/>in VS Code or GitHub Copilot app"]

    C --> D["PnP PowerShell retrieves<br/>approved SharePoint chunks"]

    D --> E["GitHub Copilot runs<br/>repository render skills"]

    E --> F["Publisher reviews<br/>validation and preview"]

    F --> G{"Release accepted?"}

    G -- "No" --> H["Correct issue<br/>and rerun"]
    H --> E

    G -- "Yes" --> I["PnP PowerShell publishes<br/>generated outputs to SharePoint"]

    I --> J["Update publication status<br/>and notify stakeholders"]
